Always use SAPUI5 1.120 controls.

Allowed libraries:
- sap.m
- sap.f
- sap.uxap
- sap.ui.layout
- sap.ui.core

Do not invent controls.

Prefer:
- ObjectPageLayout
- DynamicPage
- FlexibleColumnLayout
- sap.m.Table

Avoid:
- Deprecated controls
- Custom CSS if a UI5 control exists

All generated code must be compatible with SAP BTP Work Zone Standard.